 "remarks": "Rarely available end unit with natural light and added privacy. This fully renovated 1-bedroom condo features a modern kitchen, stylish bathroom with walk-in shower, private balcony, and in-unit washer/dryer. Located on the second level, it offers quiet living with no upstairs neighbors.  Secure building with reserved parking space and visitor parking.  On-site storage facility.  Prime location - just a 5-minute walk to:  Cove Island Park with two beaches, hiking trails, tennis, basketball, and softball fields,  Cove Island Marina with boat slips,  Cove Island Wildlife Sanctuary,  Terry Conners Ice Skating Rink,  Chelsea Piers Athletic Club of Connecticut.  Close to shopping, dining, public transportation, and I-95.",
